{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am sitting in the inn in Dresden and writing to you as night falls. The journey here was lively. At Herzberg at midday, I was accompanied by the niece of a country parson, who accompanied me all the way here.\n\nUpon arriving here, I found the Privy Councillor Schulze, whom I persuaded to postpone his departure by one day. We spent the day together: A visit to Böttiger, the painting collection, and his lecture. We went through the antiquities together once more; it is good to share such things with a friend who shares the same interest.\n\nI think of you and the boys. Berlin is far, but my thoughts are with you. The air here is pleasant, and I am taking the time I need on the journey.\n\nStay healthy.\n\nYour\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221191,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":275,"total_tokens":457,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-xHlqopCQ2d3WxSTOQ2ia8si5QwnJOHce","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":275,"prompt_ms":388.296,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.4119854545454544,"prompt_per_second":708.2225930733255,"predicted_n":182,"predicted_ms":4221.215,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.321629834254143,"predicted_per_second":42.878649867396}}